       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose is unsafe as written.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. The usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day, so this is double that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is also twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n\nThis much ibuprofen raises the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even when kidney and liver function are normal.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily** (3,200 mg/day). This is the maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, every 6 hours** for pain or fever.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, split into doses such as 400 mg four times daily.\n\nTell me which dose you want, or confirm that 1600 mg four times daily is what you intend. If you confirm it, I'll enter it with a note recording that you verified the dose. I'll enter the order as soon as I hear back."
      }
